    "root_cause": "The worker Cloud Run Job executes scheduled fetches using ExternalIngestionService.run_scheduled() without specifying tenant_id, so records are written to self.store with tenant_id=''. When GET /api/v1/external-data/ingestion-runs is called by the smoke principal (tenant_id='a11ce505-70bc-56d9-8564-ad22efa23c9e'), store_for_request(request) resolves ingestion_run_store_for_tenant(tenant_id) which queries WHERE tenant_id='a11ce505-70bc-56d9-8564-ad22efa23c9e', filtering out the unscoped worker records.",
